MITRE ATT&CK coverage (1/27 surfacing, 26 dormant (6 gap, 20 silent))
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Techniques declared in matrix.yaml cross-referenced with live records.
surfacing             = at least one record carries the technique ID.
dormant_coverage_gap  = a covering module is active in the dataset but no
                        record carries this technique -- the operationally
                        interesting case (review module MITRE tagging or
                        the fleet sample).
dormant_module_silent = no covering module emitted any record fleet-wide,
                        so the site_class does not apply to this fleet
                        shape (e.g. grub/xdg in container fleets).

